   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Neon Sign\n\nA glass neon tube stutters alive segment by segment, buzzes off once, then holds lit with a glow on the wall. Replace the path variable with your own monoline SVG path.\n\nCategory: logo-stings. Length: 2.333 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- The brand, venue or event has a nightlife, retro or hand-lettered feel and the sting should look like a lit sign.\n- Your mark or word exists as a monoline SVG path, so each stroke can light as its own tube.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Your logo is a filled image rather than a stroke path: wrap it with spotlight or anamorphic-flare instead.\n- Letters should draw on as clean outlines without the neon look: use outline-trace.\n\nVariables:\n- path (string): Tube path, default \"M 30 132 C 52 112 74 70 70 46 C 67 28 50 30 47 52 C 44 76 42 112 40 140 C 46 116 58 100 72 100 C 86 100 84 122 86 134 C 88 144 100 144 110 132 M 110 132 C 124 124 142 110 136 98 C 130 88 112 96 112 116 C 112 138 134 146 156 130 M 156 130 C 176 110 196 66 190 46 C 186 32 170 36 168 60 C 166 90 168 126 172 136 C 176 146 188 142 196 132 M 196 132 C 216 110 232 66 226 46 C 222 32 206 36 204 60 C 202 90 204 126 208 136 C 212 146 224 142 232 132 M 232 132 C 238 116 248 100 262 100 C 278 100 280 124 268 136 C 256 146 242 136 248 118 C 252 106 268 104 290 104 M 52 170 C 120 160 210 162 296 152\"\n- color (color): Tube, default \"#E5322D\"\n- glow_color (color): Glow, default \"#E5322D\"\n- tube_color (color): Unlit tube, default \"#2A2A2A\"\n- core_color (color): Core, default \"#FFFFFF\"\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#111111\"\n- stroke_width (number, 2-14): Tube thickness, default 6\n- fit (number, 0.3-0.9): Fit, default 0.62\n- seed (number, 1-99): Seed, default 7\n- speed (number, 0.25-3): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
